# Production safety

- never commit secrets or paste credentials in chat
- no prod writes without explicit environment confirmation
- no destructive ops without approval
- prefer read-only investigation first

Use `/builder-schema` for schema/data change planning with prod gates; use `/builder-infrastructure` for IaC changes.
